        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Should a doctor of the employee's choice dispute the Company doctor's opinion of the recovery or expected recovery time, the employee shall be examined by a health care provider who has been mutually agreed upon and such provider shall make the final determination of the employee's recovery and ability to resume their current position. The cost of examination by such medical staff and transportation costs to and from such hospital for these examinations shall be born by the Company.",
